  <h2 id="status">A brand-new startup, built in India</h2>
  <p>
    avaTOK is built in India by a small founding team working from Dehradun. We are building a
    platform where people earn money from what they already know and who they already are — and
    right now we are doing the earliest part of that work: turning an idea into a product and
    testing it with people we invite.
  </p>
  <LegalStatus variant="full" />

